# Local config (secrets + machine-specific paths). Copy config.json.example -> config.json.
config.json
!config.json.example

# Dependencies
node_modules/

# Lockfiles are environment-specific here; uncomment to pin if desired.
# bun.lock
# package-lock.json

# Local runtime state & logs
